flowchart TD
  A["<img src='/Users/daniel_defra/Documents/prototypes/forms-prototype/docs/copy-page-flow-screenshots/01-page-overview.png' width='420' /><br/>Page overview — click Copy page"]
  A --> B["<img src='/Users/daniel_defra/Documents/prototypes/forms-prototype/docs/copy-page-flow-screenshots/02-confirmation.png' width='420' /><br/>Confirmation — name, question count,<br/>conditions will not be copied"]
  B -->|Cancel| Z[Stay on original page overview]
  B -->|Copy page| C[Clone page + questions · omit conditions · insert after source]
